00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:46.350
All the other demos have
had all these services

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:49.915
running on the cluster,
so in Kubernetes.

00:13:49.915 --> 00:13:51.540
And again, you can
see, they're written

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:52.832
in lots of different languages.

00:13:52.832 --> 00:13:53.582
It doesn't matter.

00:13:53.582 --> 00:13:55.200
At Istio, we can get
all the telemetry

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:59.040
and do all the controls
no matter the language.

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:00.750
I've circled one
in the bottom here,

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:03.570
this catalog service where
