and the Kubernetes cluster.

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:53.470
OK.

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:54.512
Let's switch to the demo.

00:14:57.510 --> 00:15:01.980
So first of all, for all
the instructions and setup

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:04.810
that I'm doing today, you
