00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:07.230
on istio.io website.

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:10.260
And here you can find
the setup and how

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:16.690
to run the workloads on the
VM and what kind of operations

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:20.130
you need to for
