telemetry, and traffic

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.180
management out of the box.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:02.130
Great!

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:05.130
So except one thing, the
product catalog services

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.350
somehow still runs on the VM.

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:10.950
And you still want to wire
things together and behave

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:13.910
as a single mesh.

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:16.100
So we are going to just do it.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:24.980
So the first thing,
of course, you

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:29.610
